  "title": "TWFG Announces Launch of Initial Public Offering",
  "summary": "PDF Version July 9, 2024 | The Woodlands, TX — TWFG, Inc. (“TWFG”) today announced the launch of its initial public offering of its Class A common stock. TWFG is offering 11,000,000 shares of its Class A common stock pursuant to a registration statement on Form S-1 filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission (“SEC”). […]",
